msgid "Before declaring production ready, reconcile all 24 Queues, apply D1 migrations, build all three Workers, and verify apex, www, wildcard DNS, health, discovery, JWKS, and Hosted Auth. Then record live evidence for Email, DLQ replay, privacy export and 30-day erasure, hourly and daily Cron, Analytics, Turnstile, and custom hostnames. Local L0-L3 evidence is not L4; every unrun live check is UNKNOWN. The full operator runbook is maintained at https://github.com/StringKe/xid/blob/main/docs/deployment.md."
