#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "Package status is <0>Implemented and verified locally</0>. The Swift unit-test suite passes on macOS for the iOS package. Simulator or device behavior and a real IdP round-trip on a running XID instance remain pending manual verification. This page documents implemented behavior; it is not a production-readiness claim."
